QZVPP-MOLOPT-UZH-PBE-ae
=======================

All-electron orbital basis. Use an all-electron Hamiltonian (ALL in CP2K).

Native CP2K aliases: QZVPP-MOLOPT-PBE-ae, QZVPP-MOLOPT-GGA-ae.
Published UZH protocol source: mirhosseini2026a.
See the molopt_uzh family notes for provenance and q-value matching.
